From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Thu Nov 15 18:42:14 2026
From: Mark Birss <mark.birss@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Nov 2026 18:42:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: spi-nor: add support for EON EN25QE16A

The GL-MG1300 uses a 2MB EON EN25QE16A (JEDEC ID 0x1c4115) SPI-NOR flash
for bootloader and factory data.

Signed-off-by: Mark Birss <mark.birss@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/mtd/spi-nor/eon.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/eon.c
+++ b/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/eon.c
@@ -25,4 +25,6 @@ static const struct flash_info eon_nor_p
 	{ "en25q80a",   INFO(0x1c3014, 0, 64 * 1024,   16)
 		NO_SFDP_FLAGS(SECT_4K | SPI_NOR_DUAL_READ) },
+	{ "en25qe16a",  INFO(0x1c4115, 0, 64 * 1024,   32)
+		NO_SFDP_FLAGS(SECT_4K) },
 	{ "en25qh16",   INFO(0x1c7015, 0, 64 * 1024,   32)
 		NO_SFDP_FLAGS(SECT_4K | SPI_NOR_DUAL_READ) },
